# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# Comments must sit on their own line: git has no end-of-line comments, so
# "config/api_keys.json   # ..." used to be a pattern that matched nothing and
# left the API key file free to be committed.
# Your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
config/api_keys.json
# The dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/certs/
# A LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands somebody your WhatsApp
# account, not just a key
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins) and client secrets
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db
# The copy MEMORY → RESET ALL keeps of what it erased
memory/long_term.backup.json

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# ── Claude's working folder ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Agent scratch files, skill drafts and the cached skill catalogue. The skills
# themselves (workspace/.claude/skills/) stay trackable on purpose: a skill is
# code you may want to keep and share.
workspace/*
!workspace/.claude/
workspace/.claude/*
!workspace/.claude/skills/
